WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.713
One gas, two futures.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.147
Boltzmann solutions exist forever. Are they fixed

3
00:00:05.147 --> 00:00:07.495
by their start? Cold jets say no.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.232
A rare collision cascade happens in one future and not the other.

5
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.968
Claimed: two distinct global solutions, one start.

6
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:18.779
Lean checks part.
